#N canvas 120 60 1200 640 12;
#X text 20 10 fs_sphere_voice <index> <owner> - one target of [fs_sphere] \, loaded 64 times by [clone]. Inlet: level <0..1> (per sensor frame) | note <midi> | attack <ms> | release <ms> | audition <ms> (sound the note for ms through its own attack/release \, bypassing pointing and the motion gate \; resending extends it). If level frames stop for 300 ms (sensor dropout \, streaming stopped) the note rings out through its release instead of holding. Shared per sphere (sent by the owning fs_sphere): <owner>-gate \, <owner>-energy \, <owner>-attack \, <owner>-release. Switches its own DSP off while silent \, so unused voices cost almost nothing., f 120;
#X obj 20 110 inlet;
#X obj 20 140 route level note attack release audition;
#X obj 20 200 fs_smooth 40 600;
#X obj 250 100 r \$2-attack;
#X obj 400 100 r \$2-release;
#X obj 20 250 *;
#X obj 120 220 r \$2-gate;
#X obj 20 400 max;
#X obj 20 450 fs_partials 60;
#X obj 250 420 r \$2-energy;
#X obj 20 520 outlet~;
#X obj 450 450 > 0.0001;
#X obj 450 480 change;
#X obj 450 540 switch~;
#X obj 600 450 loadbang;
